      "zh": "亚兰人离开约阿施的时候，他患重病；臣仆背叛他，要报祭司耶何耶大儿子流血之仇，杀他在床上，葬他在大卫城，只是不葬在列王的坟墓里。",
      "en": "When they withdrew, they left Joash[NOTE:1] badly wounded. His servants plotted against him because of what he had done to[NOTE:2] the son[NOTE:3] of Jehoiada the priest. They murdered him on his bed. Thus[NOTE:4] he died and was buried in the City of David,[NOTE:5] but not in the tombs of the kings.",
